# Fonts Directory

Place your custom web fonts here:
- TTF files
- OTF files
- WOFF/WOFF2 files
- EOT files

## Usage
Reference fonts in your Sass files:
```scss
@font-face {
    font-family: 'CustomFont';
    src: url('/assets/fonts/CustomFont.woff2') format('woff2'),
         url('/assets/fonts/CustomFont.woff') format('woff');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-style: normal;
}
```
